=== Gravity Defied ===
Gravity Defied was born as a J2ME mobile game in 2004 and have had lots of fans in both the trial racing and gaming community. Now over eight years have passed and we thought it was time to bring a new android version to the world that we hope will be as fun as the original!

The game is under development and new features will be added as often as possible.

Enjoy!

=== Codebrew Software ===
Codebrew is a three person strong team that enjoy writing games as a hobby. We are located in Stockholm, Sweden and spend a few evenings and weekends a month hacking away at Gravity Defied.

If you have any thoughts about the game or any questions in general you can reach us at feedback@codebrew.se.
